@base = http://localhost:5080
@claimId = REPLACE_WITH_CLAIM_ID
@version = REPLACE_WITH_LATEST_CLAIM_VERSION
@requestId = REPLACE_WITH_INFORMATION_REQUEST_ID

### Submit as Alice. Copy id and version from response.
POST {{base}}/api/claims
Authorization: Bearer customer-alice
Content-Type: application/json

{"type":"Motor","incidentAt":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","incidentDetails":"Collision damage","claimedAmount":2500.50}

### My claims
GET {{base}}/api/claims?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer customer-alice

### Customer view
GET {{base}}/api/claims/{{claimId}}
Authorization: Bearer customer-alice

### Shared queue
GET {{base}}/api/staff/queue
Authorization: Bearer staff-demo

### Start review. Refresh version after EVERY write.
POST {{base}}/api/claims/{{claimId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer staff-demo
If-Match: "{{version}}"

### Estimate
PUT {{base}}/api/claims/{{claimId}}/estimate
Authorization: Bearer staff-demo
If-Match: "{{version}}"
Content-Type: application/json

{"estimatedLiability":1800.25}

### Information request
POST {{base}}/api/claims/{{claimId}}/information-requests
Authorization: Bearer staff-demo
If-Match: "{{version}}"
Content-Type: application/json

{"question":"Please confirm the incident location."}

### Text reply; optional files use the same multipart request.
POST {{base}}/api/claims/{{claimId}}/information-requests/{{requestId}}/reply
Authorization: Bearer customer-alice
If-Match: "{{version}}"
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=chubb-demo-boundary

--chubb-demo-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="text"

The incident occurred in Kuala Lumpur.
--chubb-demo-boundary--

### Approve (requires estimate); Rejected also accepted.
POST {{base}}/api/claims/{{claimId}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer staff-demo
If-Match: "{{version}}"
Content-Type: application/json

{"decision":"Approved","reason":"Covered damage."}

### Workload
GET {{base}}/api/staff/workload
Authorization: Bearer staff-demo

### Manager totals
GET {{base}}/api/manager/outstanding
Authorization: Bearer manager-demo

### Drill into missing Property estimates
GET {{base}}/api/manager/outstanding/claims?type=Property&withoutEstimate=true
Authorization: Bearer manager-demo
